    "model": "Seasonality: most tourists visit in the summer months, so business falls off sharply in winter.\nEmployment: many tourism jobs are only seasonal, leaving workers without income for part of the year.\nInvestment: low off-season trade makes it hard for businesses to pay for upkeep and new facilities.",
