    "model": "Challenge 1: Overcrowded reception accommodation.\nArrivals in 2015-16 far outnumbered the reception places built by member states, so many people had to be housed in emergency camps.\nChallenge 2: Unequal burden between member states.\nUnder the Dublin Regulation the first state of arrival must process the application, so Greece and Italy carry most of the burden.",
