    "label": "7C",
    "marks": 30,
    "model": "Named example 1 – Corrib gas, County Mayo:\nThe Corrib gas field lies about 80 km off north-west County Mayo and was discovered in 1996.\nThe economic case was energy security, a domestic gas supply, revenue for the State and the companies, and construction jobs.\nAfter it first flowed in December 2015, Corrib for a time supplied over half of Ireland's gas.\nThe original plan to pipe high-pressure, unprocessed gas onshore near homes at Rossport created a safety risk for residents.\nSruwaddacon Bay, a protected estuary, lay on the pipeline route, so environmental interests were threatened.\nThe Shell to Sea campaign from 2005 argued that the gas should be processed at sea rather than onshore.\nThe Rossport Five were jailed in June 2005 for refusing to obey a court order, and the dispute divided the local community.\nThe conflict was eased by compromise, as the route was moved further from houses and a tunnel was bored under Sruwaddacon Bay.\nNamed example 2 – Amazon rainforest, Brazil:\nCattle ranching is the main driver of clearing in the Amazon, and most cleared land becomes pasture, with soya farming spreading in the south.\nThe Trans-Amazonian Highway, begun in 1970, opened the forest to settlers, and clearings along roads form a fishbone pattern, as in Rondônia.\nCarajás in Pará has the world's largest iron-ore mine, run by Vale, and the Belo Monte dam on the Xingu River was completed in 2019 despite opposition from indigenous groups including the Kayapó.\nThe forest holds biodiversity, stores large amounts of carbon and recycles rainfall, so its loss is a global environmental concern.\nClearing fell by over 80% between 2004 and 2012 but rose again to about 13,000 km² in 2021, showing that policy swings shape the conflict.\nProtection measures include the Forest Code, the 2006 soy moratorium and the Amazon Fund of 2008, which is paid for mainly by Norway and Germany.\nChico Mendes, a rubber tapper who campaigned to protect the forest, was murdered at Xapuri in 1988, showing that the conflict is between people as well as interests.",
