    "model": "Fiscal pressure: the government must pay pensions and healthcare for more elderly people from taxes.\nThis may force higher taxes on workers, lower pension benefits or a later retirement age.\nLabour shortage: there are fewer young workers for each retired person.\nThis can make it harder for employers to fill jobs and may slow economic growth.",
