    "model": "Water and sanitation shortage: existing water supplies and sewerage systems cannot cope with the extra people.\nThis can spread disease in crowded areas.\nHousing shortage: there are not enough homes for the growing urban population.\nThis leads to overcrowded informal settlements with poor living conditions.",
