    "model": "Draw the outline of North America filling the page, with the title North America at the top.\nShow the Pacific coast on the west, the Atlantic coast on the east and the Gulf of Mexico in the south-east.\nShow the Rocky Mountains as a relief feature running north to south in the west, labelled Rocky Mountains.\nShow the Mississippi River flowing from the north-centre south into the Gulf of Mexico, labelled Mississippi River.\nMark New York on the east coast with a dot and label it New York as an urban area.\nMark Los Angeles on the west coast with a dot and label it Los Angeles as an urban area.",
