    "model": "Skilled workforce: Dublin has a large pool of well-educated, English-speaking graduates from its universities.\nSkilled workforce: these graduates have the skills that multinational companies need.\nLow tax and EU access: Ireland's corporation tax rate of 12.5% is one of the lowest in Europe.\nLow tax and EU access: Dublin gives access to the EU Single Market of over 500 million consumers.",
