    "model": "Draw a line graph on graph paper, with the title: Estimated number of immigrants to Ireland, 2010 to 2018.\nVertical axis: draw it on the left side, labelled Number of immigrants, with a scale from 0 to 100,000 in steps of 20,000.\nHorizontal axis: draw it along the bottom, labelled Year, with the years 2010, 2012, 2014, 2016 and 2018 evenly spaced.\nPlot 2010 at 42,000 immigrants.\nPlot 2012 at 57,000 immigrants.\nPlot 2014 at 67,000 immigrants.\nPlot 2016 at 82,000 immigrants.\nPlot 2018 at 90,000 immigrants.\nJoin the five points with straight lines.",
    "model_source": "haiku",
