    "marks": 20,
    "model": "Title: Ireland, written at the top of the sheet.\nOutline: the island of Ireland, drawn as a clear outline of its coastline.\nRegion: Munster, shaded in the south of the island, with its name written inside it.\nUpland: the Galtee Mountains, shaded on the eastern side of Munster and named.\nUrban centre: Limerick, shown as a dot on the River Shannon estuary and named.\nRiver: the River Shannon, drawn as a line flowing south-west into the Atlantic through Munster and named.",
    "model_source": "haiku",
