    "model": "Tackling climate change: renewable energy produces little or no greenhouse gas.\nThis helps countries cut emissions and meet their climate targets.\nEnergy security: renewable energy is produced at home, so countries depend less on imported fuel.\nThis protects them from rises in world oil and gas prices.",
