    "marks": 4,
    "model": "Earthquake-resistant buildings: construct buildings with flexible frames, reinforced concrete and base isolators.\nReduced damage: the building can move with the seismic waves instead of breaking apart, so it is less likely to collapse and people inside are better protected.",
    "model_source": "haiku",
