    "model": "(i) 16,647 people.\n(ii) €281 million.\n(iii) Working: EU €397 million + Asia €80 million + UK €79 million = €556 million.\n(iii) Combined exports: €556 million.\n(iv) Salmon.\n(iv) Cod.\n(v) Killybegs.\n(v) Howth.\n(vi) Fishing provides jobs, with 16,647 people employed in the sector.\n(vi) These workers pay tax and spend their wages locally, which boosts coastal communities.",
