    "marks": 30,
    "model": "(i) Germany.\n(ii) Ireland.\n(iii) Poland.\n(iii) Bulgaria.\n(iv) Working: EU Average male 77.5 years minus Bulgaria male 70 years = 7.5 years.\n(iv) Difference: 7.5 years.\n(v) Reason 1, healthcare: countries with good hospitals and doctors have better access to treatment.\n(v) Reason 1, healthcare: diseases are caught and treated early, so people live longer.\n(v) Reason 2, income and diet: richer countries can afford a healthy diet and clean water.\n(v) Reason 2, income and diet: people with a better standard of living are less likely to die young from poverty related illness.",
