    "model": "(i) Draw a bar chart on graph paper.\nTitle it: Expected Years of Schooling for Selected Countries, 2019.\nLabel the vertical axis: Years of Schooling, scaled from 0 to 20 in steps of 2.\nLabel the horizontal axis: Country, with the five countries evenly spaced.\nThe Ireland bar reaches 19 years.\nThe Brazil bar reaches 15 years.\nThe Mali bar reaches 8 years.\nThe Saudi Arabia bar reaches 16 years.\nThe Japan bar reaches 15 years.\n(ii) Higher productivity: educated workers can use machinery and new techniques to produce more goods and services.\nThis raises national output and income.",
