    "model": "Challenge one, Brexit: the UK left the EU in 2020, so the EU lost a large member and a major contributor to its budget.\nChallenge one, Brexit: the remaining members must cover the budget gap, which causes disagreement over spending.\nChallenge two, migration: large numbers of people arriving from outside the EU put pressure on housing, services and borders.\nChallenge two, migration: member states disagree over how refugees should be shared out between them.",
