    "model": "Use graph paper to draw a bar chart.\nTitle: Unemployment rate for 25 to 74 year olds in Ireland, 2018 to 2023.\nVertical axis: labelled Unemployment rate (%), scaled from 0 to 6 in even steps.\nHorizontal axis: labelled Year, with the years 2018 to 2023 in order from left to right.\n2018: a bar at 4.8%.\n2019: a bar at 4.1%.\n2020: a bar at 4.4%.\n2021: a bar at 5.0%.\n2022: a bar at 4.2%.\n2023: a bar at 4.0%.",
