    "model": "Outline: draw a closed outline of Ireland with roughly correct proportions, showing the indentations of Donegal Bay and Dublin Bay, and draw a frame around the map.\nRegion: shade the west of Ireland along the Atlantic coast, including Galway and County Clare, and label it West region.\nRiver: draw the River Shannon as a continuous blue line from the midlands to the Shannon Estuary, and label it River Shannon.\nTown: mark Galway city with a dot on Galway Bay and label it Galway.\nRelief: shade the Connemara Mountains in County Galway and label them Connemara Mountains.",
