    "marks": 16,
    "model": "Title: Average Life Expectancy at Birth by Continent, 2023, written at the top of the graph.\nPaper: Drawn on graph paper.\nVertical axis: Labelled Life expectancy (years) and scaled from 0 to 80 in divisions of 10 years.\nHorizontal axis: Labelled Continent, with the six continents spaced evenly along it.\nAfrica: A bar reaching 63 years on the vertical axis.\nAsia: A bar reaching 74 years.\nEurope: A bar reaching 78 years.\nNorth America: A bar reaching 76 years.\nOceania: A bar reaching 79 years.\nSouth America: A bar reaching 74 years.",
