    "marks": 16,
    "model": "Title: UNESCO World Heritage Sites by Country, written at the top of the graph.\nPaper: Drawn on graph paper.\nVertical axis: Labelled Number of sites and scaled from 0 to 8, with a division every 1 site.\nHorizontal axis: Labelled Country, with the six countries spaced evenly along it.\nBelarus: A bar reaching 4 sites.\nChile: A bar reaching 7 sites.\nEgypt: A bar reaching 7 sites.\nHungary: A bar reaching 8 sites.\nIceland: A bar reaching 3 sites.\nIreland: A bar reaching 2 sites.",
