    "model": "Frame: a ruled landscape rectangle about half the size of the photograph, with the title Sketch map of the aerial photograph of Oughterard.\nCar park: a small grey rectangle in the right middleground, beside the sports ground, labelled Car park.\nCBD: a cluster of joined building shapes along the main street in the centre middleground, labelled CBD.\nChurch: a small cross-shaped building in the centre foreground, just left of the housing, labelled Church.\nSemi-detached housing: rows of paired house shapes along curved roads in the centre foreground, labelled Semi-detached housing.\nRecreational activity: a closed rectangle with goalposts in the right middleground, labelled Sports pitch.\nAlso draw the main street as a line from the bottom centre running up to the centre right.",
