    "model": "Challenge one: Shortage of skilled workers.\nExplanation: Many firms cannot find enough trained staff for specialised jobs, so production slows down.\nChallenge two: Dependence on a small number of large export markets.\nExplanation: If demand falls in one of these countries, Irish industries lose a large share of their sales.",
