    "model": "(i) 300 solar panels.\n(ii) 128 kWh.\n(iii) The project cuts carbon emissions at the park by 37 tonnes each year.\n(iv) Solar power.\nWind power.\n(v) Solar panels only generate electricity when the sun shines, so the supply is unreliable.\nA back-up energy source is needed on cloudy days and at night, which adds to the cost.",
