    "model": "Graph paper: draw a vertical bar chart on graph paper, using a ruler, with the title Expected Years of Schooling, 2023.\nVertical axis: label it Expected Years of Schooling (years) and scale it from 0 to 20 in equal steps of 2, starting at 0.\nHorizontal axis: label it Country and space the five countries equally along it, with each bar centred above its label.\nGreece: a bar rising to 20 years.\nNorway: a bar rising to 18 years.\nChad: a bar rising to 8 years.\nSerbia: a bar rising to 15 years.\nMadagascar: a bar rising to 9 years.\n(ii) Low income: families in poorer countries often cannot afford school fees and books.\nChild labour: many children must work to support their families instead of attending school.",
